{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1473015-starting-legend-xp","id":1473015,"title":"Starting Legend/XP?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-01-21T19:31:38-08:00","id":1473015,"title":"Starting Legend/XP?","content":"So, I know that in 1st Edition there were rules for generating characters past Legend 1. There aren't any official rules for the same in 2nd Edition, so has anyone created fan rules for generating &quot;experienced&quot; characters? Such as playing a character that's Legend 2, 3 and so on at the start of the campaign?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-22T01:38:21-08:00","id":1473021,"title":"","content":"Legend and XP are independent, you can easily have a Demigod with no more XP than a initial character.<br /> <br /> My personal suggestion is, don\u2019t worry about XP, it will just accelerate the time needed to fill your char sheet dots. If you want a higher Legend character, give enough knacks to cover all the Calling dots, and go for it. That\u2019s basically the way they went when you have an initial Origin character and an initial Hero character, also almost sure it\u2019s the same for initial Demigods.<br /> <br /> If you really need XP, I would suggest 5 XP per session times 5 sessions per legend dot, so 25 XP per legend dot. It\u2019s not a rule, but 5 sessions is enough to explore the powers you have in a certain legend level, and 5 XP should be the average XP per session if everybody play it nicely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}